"CaptureSoundSetupDialog||<p><strong>Voice Activity Detection</strong> automatically detects your voice the moment you begin speaking (as well as when you stop speaking) and will enable or disable your microphone accordingly. This facilitates hands-free communication through TeamSpeak.</p><p>This method is not recommended in noisy environments since background noise may mistakenly be detected and transmitted to other users.</p>": "<p><strong>语音活动检测</strong>会在您开始说话（以及停止说话）的瞬间自动检测您的声音，并相应地开启或关闭麦克风。这样可以实现 TeamSpeak 的免提通话。</p><p>不建议在嘈杂环境中使用此方式，因为背景噪音可能会被误判并传输给其他用户。</p>",
"CaptureSoundSetupDialog||<p>With <strong>Continuous Transmission</strong> voice data is constantly transmitted. It is recommended to use Push-To-Talk or Voice Activity Detection instead to lower bandwidth usage.</p>": "<p>使用<strong>持续传输</strong>时会一直发送语音数据。建议改用按键发言或语音活动检测，以降低带宽占用。</p>",
