"HotkeysSetup||To be able to use hotkeys on Mac, you need to open the System preferences\n\"Security & Privacy\" page, select tab \"Privacy\", select \"Accessibility\"\nand check \"TeamSpeak 3 Client\". If it does not exist in the list, drag&drop\nit from your Applications folder.": "要在 Mac 上使用热键，请打开系统偏好设置的\n\"安全性与隐私\"页面，选择\"隐私\"标签页，选中\"辅助功能\"，\n然后勾选\"TeamSpeak 3 Client\"。如果列表中没有该项，请从\n\"应用程序\"文件夹中将它拖放进去。",
"HotkeysSetup||To be able to use hotkeys on Mac, you need to open the System preferences\n\"Universal Access\" page and make sure \"Enable access for assistive devices\"\nis turned on.": "要在 Mac 上使用热键，请打开系统偏好设置的\n\"万能辅助\"页面，并确保已开启\"启用辅助设备访问\"。",
